<title>THAILAND: Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</title>
<headline>Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were loading or announced at Bangkok port, the Thai Tapioca Association said.</p>
<p> Departure	    Charter	 Date	  Tonnes</p>
<p> HEREKE 4		 (IAT)	 01/04/97     32,000</p>
<p> IDC 1		    (IAT)	 07/04/97     34,000</p>
<p> HILAL II		 (ACT)	 08/04/97     23,000</p>
<p> FORESTAL ESPERANZA   (IAT)	 09/04/97     52,000</p>
<p>In port</p>
<p> JIN PU HAI	     (ACT)	 16/04/97     68,000</p>
<p> HAFNIA		   (ACT)	 18/04/97     14,000</p>
<p> DELTA PRIDE	    (STC)	 29/04/97     60,000</p>
